# A symlink to the accepted V1 branch's OOF residual dataset. The repair
# candidate is fitted and validated on exactly the same residuals as the
# control, so pointing at that one file is what makes the comparison paired
# rather than a re-derivation. The dataset itself is excluded from version
# control on the parent branch and identified by hash; see
# ../game_latent_state/.gitignore and residual_manifest.json there.
oof_gaussian_residuals.parquet
__pycache__/
